{"results": [{"name": "Rachael Ray Every Day", "entity_id": "E5BBC0A2-09AF-436B-BB1A-90FEBA0032F9", "types": ["urn:entity:brand"], "properties": {"akas": [], "description": "Rachael Ray Every Day is a prominent lifestyle and culinary brand centered on the philosophy of making home cooking accessible, efficient, and enjoyable. Originally launched as a magazine, it provides a wealth of quick, family-friendly recipes, meal-planning strategies, and practical kitchen tips. Its content is designed to resonate with busy individuals and parents who value flavorful, uncomplicated meals over complex techniques. By maintaining an approachable tone, the brand has established itself as a reliable resource for everyday dining and home management.", "external": {"instagram": {"id": "rachaelraymag"}, "twitter": {"id": "rachaelraymag"}}, "founded_year": "2005", "image": {"url": "https://images.qloo.com/i/E5BBC0A2-09AF-436B-BB1A-90FEBA0032F9-420x-auto.jpg"}, "short_description": "Rachael Ray Every Day is a lifestyle and cooking brand offering quick, tasty recipes and cooking tips inspired by Rachael Ray's approachable style.", "short_descriptions": [{"language": "en", "value": "A lifestyle brand providing quick, approachable recipes and culinary tips inspired by a warm, everyday cooking philosophy."}, {"language": "es", "value": "Una marca de estilo de vida que ofrece recetas rápidas y sencillas junto a consejos culinarios, inspirada en una filosofía de cocina cotidiana, accesible y reconfortante."}, {"language": "de", "value": "Eine Lifestyle-Marke für schnelle, alltagstaugliche Rezepte und Kochtipps, die von einer zugänglichen und herzlichen Art zu kochen inspiriert ist."}, {"language": "fr", "value": "Une marque lifestyle proposant des recettes rapides et accessibles ainsi que des conseils culinaires, inspirée par une philosophie de cuisine simple et quotidienne."}]}, "popularity": 0.895306063636826, "disambiguation": "", "tags": [{"name": "Entertainment", "tag_id": "urn:tag:genre